What to test:

- Toggling between disabled, fixed and auto rotation modes applies the expected label angles on both axes.
- Switching between uniform and irregular label sets triggers auto-rotation as needed without overlap.
- Resizing the container or disabling collision detection produces the documented overflow behaviour.

